166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (We entered with ID cards and shaky hearts,  New books in hands, unsure starts.  The gates were tall, the dreams were wide,  And life began on the other side. Timetables faded, chai stalls grew,  Canteen gossip and friendships new.  Sleepless nights before the test,  Group studies where we mostly jest. From bunked lectures to freshers' nights,  To crushes hidden and silent fights.  Some found love, some found pain,  Some lost themselves, then rose again. Laughter echoed in hostel halls,  Hearts healed over mess food calls.  We found ourselves, piece by piece,  In broken dreams and moments of peace.)
/E (We entered with ID cards and shaky hearts,  New books in hands, unsure starts.  The gates were tall, the dreams were wide,  And life began on the other side. Timetables faded, chai stalls grew,  Canteen gossip and friendships new.  Sleepless nights before the test,  Group studies where we mostly jest. From bunked lectures to freshers' nights,  To crushes hidden and silent fights.  Some found love, some found pain,  Some lost themselves, then rose again. Laughter echoed in hostel halls,  Hearts healed over mess food calls.  We found ourselves, piece by piece,  In broken dreams and moments of peace.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
